OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey day, with
OL,6,Fwidespread fog during the morning,
OL,7,Fremaining cloudy in the afternoon,
OL,8,Fwith outbreaks of light rain or
OL,9,Fdrizzle by the evening. A light breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,12,Fand drizzle, clearing during the
OL,13,Fsecond half of the night. Clear spells
OL,14,Fdevelop by Monday morning. Becoming
OL,15,Fbreezy along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
