OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy periods with showers
OL,6,Fduring the morning. Sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping in places during the
OL,8,Fafternoon. A windy day, especially
OL,9,Falong the coast. Temperatures around
OL,10,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,14,Fcoming days. Cloudy periods on Tuesday
OL,15,Fgive way to prolonged sunny spells on
OL,16,FWednesday and Thursday, though breezy
OL,17,Fat times. Temperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
